@format 1
@id split.section-rename
@title Rename section
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Change a section's naming data and synchronize all section representations.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag section-rename

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Rename section request <input>
- Receive the requested section change @ flow.PFlowNameSet(...)
> guard

[guard] Check effective change <decision>
- Confirm section editing is enabled, the section exists, and its naming fields differ @ flow.PFlowNameSet(...)
? "The request changes section state" > mutate
? "The source is locked, or the request is invalid or already satisfied" > unchanged

[mutate] Change section state <process>
- Replace the section name, prefix, and suffix and record the change @ flow.PFlowNameSet(...)
- Record the section change @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Section state is unchanged.
